<figure class="content-media-figure"><img class="i-amphtml-fill-content i-amphtml-replaced-content" src="https://s2-g1.glbimg.com/0rhBidb_2piTCYDSwWzHobsMGXo=/0x0:6000x4000/984x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_59edd422c0c84a879bd37670ae4f538a/internal_photos/bs/2024/u/q/KicxShSY2grrAUJBSDew/2024-11-29t131037z-1587852487-rc21fbaykcm0-rtrmadp-3-france-notredame-macron.jpg" sizes="(max-width: 2313px) 648px, 100vw" srcset="https://s2-g1.glbimg.com/rZI5a_NG3dT5HkJiGpGPGlTQwXc=/0x0:6000x4000/1000x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_59edd422c0c84a879bd37670ae4f538a/internal_photos/bs/2024/u/q/KicxShSY2grrAUJBSDew/2024-11-29t131037z-1587852487-rc21fbaykcm0-rtrmadp-3-france-notredame-macron.jpg 1000w, https://s2-g1.glbimg.com/0rhBidb_2piTCYDSwWzHobsMGXo=/0x0:6000x4000/984x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_59edd422c0c84a879bd37670ae4f538a/internal_photos/bs/2024/u/q/KicxShSY2grrAUJBSDew/2024-11-29t131037z-1587852487-rc21fbaykcm0-rtrmadp-3-france-notredame-macron.jpg 984w, https://s2-g1.glbimg.com/fhdPUzZ8oS2CKapHGkIlClx50h0=/0x0:6000x4000/640x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_59edd422c0c84a879bd37670ae4f538a/internal_photos/bs/2024/u/q/KicxShSY2grrAUJBSDew/2024-11-29t131037z-1587852487-rc21fbaykcm0-rtrmadp-3-france-notredame-macron.jpg 640w, https://s2-g1.glbimg.com/6oLoDB_5STh7lA-mjJlP9R5-URM=/0x0:6000x4000/600x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_59edd422c0c84a879bd37670ae4f538a/internal_photos/bs/2024/u/q/KicxShSY2grrAUJBSDew/2024-11-29t131037z-1587852487-rc21fbaykcm0-rtrmadp-3-france-notredame-macron.jpg 600w" alt="Interior da Catedral de Notre Dame de Paris, na França, em 29 de novembro de 2024 — Foto: STEPHANE DE SAKUTIN/Pool via REUTERS" /></figure>
