<div class="mc-column content-text active-extra-styles" data-block-type="raw" data-block-weight="2" data-block-id="41">
<div class="content-intertitle">

<strong>Público (Portugal)</strong>

</div>
O jornal português Público destaca que Ernesto Araújo era acusado de obstruir o acesso às vacinas contra a Covid-19 e de prejudicar a diplomacia brasileira. Destaca também que a Secretaria de Governo da Presidência da República será ocupada pela deputada federal Flávia Arruda (PL), partido <span class="highlight highlighted">do "Centrão", "que sustenta a base aliada do chefe de Estado no Congresso"</span>.

</div>
<div class="row medium-uncollapsed content-media content-photo" data-block-type="backstage-photo" data-block-id="44">
<div class="mc-column content-media__container">
<div class="content-media-container glb-skeleton-box">
<figure class="content-media-figure"><img class="i-amphtml-fill-content i-amphtml-replaced-content" src="https://s2.glbimg.com/_2J5D-oB2vWGXQHkr354VVNjR4M=/0x0:1267x897/984x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_59edd422c0c84a879bd37670ae4f538a/internal_photos/bs/2021/u/0/hxf3jhRQubTiSAm3T0Zg/publico.png" sizes="(max-width: 2108px) 648px, 100vw" srcset="https://s2.glbimg.com/_1vij0-puypK1aAyWp520p1p8ec=/0x0:1267x897/1000x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_59edd422c0c84a879bd37670ae4f538a/internal_photos/bs/2021/u/0/hxf3jhRQubTiSAm3T0Zg/publico.png 1000w, https://s2.glbimg.com/_2J5D-oB2vWGXQHkr354VVNjR4M=/0x0:1267x897/984x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_59edd422c0c84a879bd37670ae4f538a/internal_photos/bs/2021/u/0/hxf3jhRQubTiSAm3T0Zg/publico.png 984w, https://s2.glbimg.com/RBEak4DWZ1OY9PipdHNDoiPxmhs=/0x0:1267x897/640x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_59edd422c0c84a879bd37670ae4f538a/internal_photos/bs/2021/u/0/hxf3jhRQubTiSAm3T0Zg/publico.png 640w, https://s2.glbimg.com/mIS-v6bDTJzppFSFLahOlhyC4Bo=/0x0:1267x897/600x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_59edd422c0c84a879bd37670ae4f538a/internal_photos/bs/2021/u/0/hxf3jhRQubTiSAm3T0Zg/publico.png 600w" alt="Público: imprensa internacional noticia reforma ministerial de Bolsonaro — Foto: Reprodução/Público" /></figure>
</div>
<p class="content-media__description ">Público: imprensa internacional noticia reforma ministerial de Bolsonaro — Foto: Reprodução/Público</p>

</div>
<strong>La Nación (Argentina)</strong>

</div>
<div class="mc-column content-text active-extra-styles" data-block-type="raw" data-block-weight="3" data-block-id="46">

O jornal argentino "La Nación" destaca que "no pior da pandemia, o presidente realiza a maior reforma de gabinete desde que chegou ao poder" e que Bolsonaro "pretende alinhar as Forças Armadas e os partidos do ''Centrão'' aliados no Congresso".

</div>
<div class="mc-column content-text active-extra-styles " data-block-type="unstyled" data-block-weight="39" data-block-id="48">
<p class="content-text__container " data-track-category="Link no Texto" data-track-links="">A reportagem destaca também a saída de Ernesto Araújo, que "surpreendeu com posturas como a negação das mudanças climáticas, considerada um dogma criado pela esquerda para prejudicar o desenvolvimento das potências ocidentais e favorecer uma maior influência da China".</p>

</div>
<div class="row medium-uncollapsed content-media content-photo" data-block-type="backstage-photo" data-block-id="49">
<div class="mc-column content-media__container">
<div class="content-media-container glb-skeleton-box">
<figure class="content-media-figure"><img class="i-amphtml-fill-content i-amphtml-replaced-content" src="https://s2.glbimg.com/Qr_5wtOPscTg_GOZpKcF5ONGf0E=/0x0:1627x897/984x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_59edd422c0c84a879bd37670ae4f538a/internal_photos/bs/2021/Y/N/NPns5PRbWILSc2UOFNQQ/lanacion.png" sizes="(max-width: 2108px) 648px, 100vw" srcset="https://s2.glbimg.com/OX9ku1a4uZaxCEK5LKOuC7-gmuQ=/0x0:1627x897/1000x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_59edd422c0c84a879bd37670ae4f538a/internal_photos/bs/2021/Y/N/NPns5PRbWILSc2UOFNQQ/lanacion.png 1000w, https://s2.glbimg.com/Qr_5wtOPscTg_GOZpKcF5ONGf0E=/0x0:1627x897/984x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_59edd422c0c84a879bd37670ae4f538a/internal_photos/bs/2021/Y/N/NPns5PRbWILSc2UOFNQQ/lanacion.png 984w, https://s2.glbimg.com/v_4HAFKc2vr9H-I76LoXNn7kmdg=/0x0:1627x897/640x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_59edd422c0c84a879bd37670ae4f538a/internal_photos/bs/2021/Y/N/NPns5PRbWILSc2UOFNQQ/lanacion.png 640w, https://s2.glbimg.com/OBXmrvg2krk2vSp0dJ-idOmz3YQ=/0x0:1627x897/600x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_59edd422c0c84a879bd37670ae4f538a/internal_photos/bs/2021/Y/N/NPns5PRbWILSc2UOFNQQ/lanacion.png 600w" alt="La Nación: imprensa internacional noticia reforma ministerial de Bolsonaro — Foto: Reprodução/La Nación" /></figure>
