<div class="bbc-997y1y eihqrxw0" data-e2e="image-placeholder">
<div class="lazyload-wrapper "><img class="e3vrtyk0 bbc-rb7xa0 e1mo64ex0" src="https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/640/cpsprodpb/6b6d/live/dc151d70-dceb-11ed-8df1-d74cbf1089d7.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1008px) 760px, 100vw" srcset="https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/6b6d/live/dc151d70-dceb-11ed-8df1-d74cbf1089d7.jpg 240w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/6b6d/live/dc151d70-dceb-11ed-8df1-d74cbf1089d7.jpg 320w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/6b6d/live/dc151d70-dceb-11ed-8df1-d74cbf1089d7.jpg 480w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/624/cpsprodpb/6b6d/live/dc151d70-dceb-11ed-8df1-d74cbf1089d7.jpg 624w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/6b6d/live/dc151d70-dceb-11ed-8df1-d74cbf1089d7.jpg 800w" alt="Arte: ilustração do Starship em Marte" width="568" height="319" /></div>
<p class="bbc-1s1cxbv ewbcsnk0" role="text"><span lang="en-GB">Musk tem a ambição de colonizar Marte com o Starship / SPACEX</span></p>

</div>
</div>
</div>
