 	<li style="font-weight: 400;"><b>Num Minuto Só</b> <span style="font-weight: 400;">—</span><span style="font-weight: 400;"> Fernanda Noronha &amp; Peu Pereira </span><span style="font-weight: 400;">— </span><span style="font-weight: 400;">Atlanta, Georgia.</span></li>
